{
  "sheet": "sounds",
  "doc": "Which Space Marine 2 sound plays on which Dark Souls III event. One row per slot; the setup tool renders each slot's SM2 event into a few WAV 'takes' and the hook picks one at random. Triggers are polled from game state each frame (read-only).",
